@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: Online Parking Payment

actor Driver as User
boundary ReactUI
control RESTAPI
control PythonApp as "Python App\n(Business Logic)"
control DAO
database DB as "PostgreSQL"
entity PaymentSystem as "Payment System"

User -> ReactUI : Display Parking Map
ReactUI -> RESTAPI : Request Availability
RESTAPI -> PythonApp : Call Search Method
PythonApp -> DAO : SQL Query for Available Spots
DAO -> DB : SELECT * FROM ParkingLots
DB --> DAO : Results
DAO --> PythonApp : Parking Spot Data
PythonApp --> RESTAPI : List of Free Spots
RESTAPI --> ReactUI : Data in JSON
ReactUI --> User : Display Spots on Map

User -> ReactUI : Select Free Spot
ReactUI -> RESTAPI : Request Price Calculation
RESTAPI -> PythonApp : Call calculatePrice Method
PythonApp -> DAO : SELECT price FROM ParkingLots WHERE id=...
DAO -> DB : Get Spot Price
DB --> DAO : Price
DAO --> PythonApp : Price
PythonApp --> RESTAPI : Booking Cost
RESTAPI --> ReactUI : JSON Price
ReactUI --> User : Display Cost

User -> ReactUI : Confirm Payment
ReactUI -> RESTAPI : Request Payment
RESTAPI -> PythonApp : Call createPayment Method
PythonApp -> PaymentSystem : API Request for Payment
PaymentSystem --> PythonApp : Payment Status (Success/Failure)
PythonApp -> DAO : INSERT INTO Transactions
DAO -> DB : Save Transaction
DB --> DAO : OK
DAO --> PythonApp : OK
PythonApp --> RESTAPI : Receipt
RESTAPI --> ReactUI : JSON Receipt
ReactUI --> User : Payment Confirmation
@enduml
